WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.647
In long form the month is stored as a value in a
column Laptop

00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:11.184
January and Laptop February occupy different rows
This shape

00:00:11.197 --> 00:00:16.885
is flexible because a new month can simply become
another row Long form

00:00:16.898 --> 00:00:22.056
is common for time-series analysis plotting grouping
and tidy analytical workflows
